### Semua produk
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### Sembunyikan produk Sold
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?hideSold=true

### Filter sesuai desain
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?size=M&condition=LIKE_NEW,GOOD_VINTAGE&minPrice=150000&maxPrice=850000

### Urut harga termurah
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?sort=price_asc

### Kategori
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories

### Cari nama (harus 2 hasil: denim)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?q=denim

### Filter tag (harus 3 hasil)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?tag=90s-denim

### Filter kategori (harus 2 hasil)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?category=hats

### Pagination (totalPages harus 4)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?page=1&limit=3

### ERROR: min lebih besar dari max (harus 400)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?minPrice=900000&maxPrice=100000

### ERROR: parameter tidak dikenal (harus 400)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?foo=1

### ERROR: size tidak valid (harus 400, 3XL sudah tidak ada)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?size=3XL